= A New Day in the Commonwealth

After DuFour's departure from the political stage and the presidential contest that followed, it seems as if an era of history is closing. The worst years of political and economic crisis are over, and <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Imperial Sovereigntism</span>'s days are numbered. Perhaps the Commonwealth will finally enter into a new era of genuine peace...

- @game_over_1934: Trigger game over.
